  <item>
    <title>Vol.003 迟到的录音，杨康之后聊金鱼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64367e259361a4e7c359d5b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64367e259361a4e7c359d5b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Apr 2023 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhqEU7DNuckHj3ED27MVpfXfLlg5.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>张哲，抖音「张多鱼」&amp; 金鱼重度爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>刘铮，纪物土佐金主理人，抖音「纪物土佐金」</span></p><span></span><p><span>姚松林，花鸟鱼虫爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span>新鱼到家，拆箱的时候是鱼友们最快乐的时刻！跟您聊聊我们记忆犹新的那些买鱼经历～</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：我的北京城 — 红料</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：快乐三弦 — 牛阿海</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留言交流。如果喜欢《金鱼漫谈》希望您能推荐给身边的鱼友，嘉宾自荐，请加微信：zz1156908212</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目大纲</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 疫情结束后第一次聚齐，聊聊金鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> 开春打籽进行时，玩儿协会系日寿的最早加温繁殖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfJ0K5Sr4pSnhj06Mbf1ESxQEB6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 纪物繁殖打头阵，宇野、凤鹅、鹅头红小苗混养，真胡闹！挑苗的时候不知所措了...</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkjBtxEugrz3Mv_H-BOFrPUAMVnS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 知识点：南泽宇野自然繁殖时间比较晚，北方基本要到5月以后，除非加温，时间才能提前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 谈谈2022年的遗憾，兰寿大赛没举办，最期待的鹅虎（鹅头红、王字虎头）争霸赛也没成型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 展望2023年，多出去走走，淄博金鱼大赛、北京兰寿大赛、鹅虎争霸赛一个都不能落！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a> 青岛鱼友趣事，最拿手的是青岛虎头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 纪物刘铮2023年想用镜头记录各种养鱼人的事迹和经验，探访鱼把式，致敬《清清来了》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 说到养育器皿，DIY才是最快乐！纪物刘铮23年自己手作水泥土佐丸钵，张多鱼准备建大池饲养金鱼。丸钵制作流程：<a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1HgeNVc71-JvTzz8jWMI_w" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1HgeNVc71-JvTzz8jWMI_w">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpKp5m6_aV8pVLtPeAGvlJkj3Dw-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2027">33:47</a> 张多鱼聊今年的繁殖计划，打籽一时爽，挑苗火葬场啊...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 纪物刘铮2023年准备引进大阪兰寿，在日本都少见的品种，玩儿的就是小众！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2344">39:04</a> 知识点：金鱼是如何界定年龄的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2968">49:28</a> 知识点：如何选出平衡感好的金鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3419">56:59</a> 越聊越发疯，开始琢磨去日本参观学习养鱼的计划，养鱼无止境</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsMXSHchHFvT4lLlmIz5NHyQzOUM.m4a" length="129029094" type="audio/mp4"/>
