  <item>
    <title>Vol.001 入坑金鱼的那些日子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634d35d02a992d56e91e60c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634d35d02a992d56e91e60c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Oct 2022 11:00:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmar500YtqKr7iNCTCqAiY2X5uxx.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>张哲，抖音「张多鱼」&amp; 金鱼重度爱好者</span><br><span>刘铮，纪物土佐金主理人</span><br><span>姚松林，花鸟鱼虫爱好者</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>从小到大，我们哥儿仨的生活总是离不开花鸟鱼虫、文玩杂项，毕业后又重新拾起养金鱼的爱好，通过播客的形式，和您聊聊我们和金鱼的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容索引</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 铮哥讲述自己和金鱼的初次相识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 铮哥人生第一次买鱼和养鱼的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 金鱼在历史上的价格历来不低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 张哲讲述自己小学时就迷恋上观赏鱼的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 从初中开始混迹十里河花鸟鱼虫市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> 姚哥初中毕业后，也忍不住开始上鱼了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 大学毕业之后，养鱼铁三角重新开始认真养鱼的趣事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3232">53:52</a> 为爱鱼奔赴天津，紫身朱顶绒球驾到</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：我的北京城 — 红料</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：快乐三弦 — 牛阿海</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留言交流。如果喜欢《金鱼漫谈》希望您能推荐给身边的鱼友，嘉宾自荐，请加微信：zz1156908212</span></p>]]></description>
